From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Treggat <taggert2222@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:35:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 15/27] llama/server/sycl : cut host time in MTP verify steps

Exact host-side changes for MTP speculative decoding, behind env
switches (default off):
- LLAMA_GRAPH_REUSE_MULTI: keep one allocated graph per small ubatch
  size; restore a scheduler snapshot instead of rebuilding
- LLAMA_SYNC_SKIP_IDLE: skip syncs on a context with no work in flight
- LLAMA_KQ_MASK_FAST, LLAMA_KV_SEQ_RM_FAST: faster mask build, seq_rm
- GGML_SYCL_GRAPH_SIG_MEMO: memoize SYCL graph signatures
- GGML_SYCL_GRAPH_RECORD_AHEAD: record a new graph right after its
  warmup submit while the GPU is busy
Also fixes LLAMA_SAMPLER_FAST_TOPK never engaging (disabled samplers are
named "?..."), with a heap select identical to std::partial_sort.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
